### Quick manual tests with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request").
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Login as the seeded demo user
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo", "password": "Demo@1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Search notes (text + tag, sorted by title)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?q=meeting&tags=urgent&sort=title,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Create a rich text note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "From VS Code",
  "content": "<h2>Hello</h2><p>This is <b>rich</b> text<script>alert(1)</script></p>",
  "tags": ["vscode", "demo"],
  "pinned": true
}

### 4. Validation error example
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "missing title" }

### 5. Export as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Admin endpoint as a normal user -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
